     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-12-15"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-04-15"></period-end>
     <target value="4">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Not achieved given the particularities of the situation. Actual value is based on 2024 data. Despite their high-altitude location, these are fertile lands. Consequently, attempts at protecting the p&#xe1;ramos have clashed with the interests of typically poor farmers. Legal delimitation, necessary for sustainability, remains incomplete because of community disputes and court decisions, highlighting governance issues that the program alone could not fix. Despite these challenges, MADS made significant progress in 2025 by advancing participatory delimitation for three major p&#xe1;ramo complexes, holding over 200 community meetings, gathering more than 3,000 citizen inputs, and reaching agreements with 20 municipalities, achieving 60 percent progress on the Santurb&#xe1;n-Berlin complex.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="0"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
